Description: A statistical analysis platform for agricultural and
    biological experimentation, opened with a single function, run_app(),
    as a point-and-click 'shiny' application in Brazilian Portuguese. It
    covers data import and validation; Fisher analysis of variance for
    completely randomised, randomised complete block and factorial designs,
    with Shapiro-Wilk and Bartlett assumption checks; multiple comparisons
    (Tukey-Kramer, Student-Newman-Keuls, Fisher's LSD, Scott-Knott, Dunnett,
    Bonferroni and Holm) with compact letter displays (Piepho, 2004
    <doi:10.1198/1061860043515>); linear, polynomial, non-linear and binomial
    regression with confidence bands, model comparison by information
    criteria (Akaike, 1974 <doi:10.1109/TAC.1974.1100705>) and agronomic
    optimum doses; non-parametric tests (Kruskal-Wallis, Friedman, Mood's
    median, Dunn); classical and bootstrap confidence intervals (Efron, 1987
    <doi:10.1080/01621459.1987.10478410>); principal component analysis,
    clustering and correlation matrices; a graphics editor with
    publication-quality export; and export of results to 'Excel', HTML or
    'Word' reports and reproducible R scripts. Every module includes a
    worked example. A complete user guide in Portuguese is available
    in the README (see URL).
